{
  "name": "Forteresse - Validation Elevation Privileges",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Validation d'elevation de privileges a distance\n\nUn demande arrive sur le webhook (body JSON) :\n{ \"userId\": 2, \"role\": \"admin\", \"demandeur\": \"admintest\", \"cible\": \"stagetest\" }\n\nLe SuperAdmin recoit un email avec boutons APPROUVER / REFUSER.\nSi approuve : n8n appelle POST /api/users/:id/role (JWT superadmin,\nRBAC verifie cote serveur, action tracee dans audit.log).\n\n1. REMPLACER l'URL dans les 2 noeuds HTTP\n2. Configurer le credential SMTP dans les noeuds Email\n3. Necessite n8n >= 1.5 (noeud Email \"Send and Wait\")",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Note - Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-700, -220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "forteresse-elevation",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseData": "Demande recue. En attente d'approbation du SuperAdmin.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Demande Elevation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-220, 0],
      "webhookId": "forteresse-elevation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://REMPLACER-VOTRE-URL/api/login",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\"username\": \"n8n-bot\", \"password\": \"{{$vars.N8N_PASSWORD}}\"}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Login API (JWT)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendAndWait",
        "fromEmail": "secops@forteresse.local",
        "toEmail": "superadmin@exemple.fr",
        "subject": "=Approbation requise : elevation de privileges",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "message": "=Une demande d'elevation de privileges attend votre decision :\n\nDemandeur : {{ $('Demande Elevation').item.json.body.demandeur }}\nUtilisateur cible : {{ $('Demande Elevation').item.json.body.cible }} (id {{ $('Demande Elevation').item.json.body.userId }})\nRole demande : {{ $('Demande Elevation').item.json.body.role }}\n\nCette action sera appliquee via l'API Forteresse et tracee dans le journal d'audit.",
        "responseType": "approval",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Approbation SuperAdmin",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-approve",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.approved }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Approuve ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [440, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://REMPLACER-VOTRE-URL/api/users/{{ $('Demande Elevation').item.json.body.userId }}/role",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Login API (JWT)').item.json.token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\"role\": \"{{ $('Demande Elevation').item.json.body.role }}\"}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Appliquer le role",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [660, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "secops@forteresse.local",
        "toEmail": "equipe-secops@exemple.fr",
        "subject": "=Elevation appliquee : {{ $json.cible }} est desormais {{ $json.nouveauRole }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "=Resultat de l'application : {{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nAction tracee dans audit.log (ROLE_CHANGED via api).",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Confirmation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [880, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "secops@forteresse.local",
        "toEmail": "equipe-secops@exemple.fr",
        "subject": "Elevation refusee par le SuperAdmin",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "La demande d'elevation a ete refusee. Aucun changement applique.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0008-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Refus",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [660, 120]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Demande Elevation": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Login API (JWT)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Login API (JWT)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Approbation SuperAdmin",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Approbation SuperAdmin": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Approuve ?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Approuve ?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Appliquer le role",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Refus",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Appliquer le role": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Confirmation",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": []
}
